        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Istanbul Technical University\n- Places: Istanbul, Turkey; Üsküdar\n- People: Gülşen, Tarkan, Sezen Aksu, Sıla, Nilüfer, Ajda Pekkan, Mustafa Ceceli, Emre Aydın\n- Buildings: Yeni Valide Mosque\n- Topics: Kayahan'ın En İyileri No.1\n\nFacts:\n- Istanbul Technical University is an international technical university located in Istanbul, Turkey.\n- Yeni Valide Mosque is an 18th-century Ottoman mosque in the Üsküdar district of Istanbul, Turkey.\n- After finishing high school, Gülşen enrolled in Istanbul Technical University, began performing at bars at the same time, and later left the university.\n- Kayahan'ın En İyileri No.1 was recorded by numerous artists, including Tarkan, Sezen Aksu, Sıla, Nilüfer, Gülşen, Ajda Pekkan, Mustafa Ceceli, and Emre Aydın.",
